---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Induction" description="Membership and induction requirements for UTA HKN.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">Membership &amp; Induction</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-slate mt-6 max-w-none">
      <p class="rounded-md border border-amber-300 bg-amber-50 p-4 text-amber-900">
        TODO: This page needs the chapter's real, current eligibility criteria and induction
        process — pull these from HKN National's bylaws and this chapter's own requirements
        (GPA/class-standing thresholds, invitation timing, dues, ceremony details) rather than
        relying on this placeholder text.
      </p>

      <h2>General Eligibility</h2>
      <p>
        Eta Kappa Nu membership is by invitation, extended to electrical and computer engineering
        students who have demonstrated academic excellence and sound character. Eligible students
        are typically contacted directly by the chapter.
      </p>

      <h2>How to Get Involved</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Watch for an invitation email from the chapter, or reach out via the <a href="/contact">Contact page</a></li>
        <li>Attend an information session</li>
        <li>Complete the induction requirements set by the chapter</li>
        <li>Participate in the induction ceremony</li>
      </ol>

      <h2>Questions?</h2>
      <p>
        Reach out any time — see the <a href="/contact">Contact</a> page for how to get in touch.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
